scripts/gemma_split.py is taken unchanged from jlens-small-models (same author, same license).

The fit corpus in corpus/prompts.json is derived from the wikitext-103-raw-v1
dataset (Salesforce/wikitext on the Hugging Face Hub), which is distributed under
CC BY-SA 3.0. See corpus/README.md.

The refusal pass reads mlabonne/harmful_behaviors and mlabonne/harmless_alpaca at
run time. No text from these datasets is included in this repository; the stored
results contain numbers only.

Model weights referenced by these scripts (Jackrong/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-Qwen3.5-9B,
xtools-at/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-Qwen3.5-9B-UNCENSORED-heretic, Qwen/Qwen3.5-9B,
